    "number": 403,
    "title": "Remove `addr` field in `ReprPtr`",
    "body": "The `addr: usize` field in `ReprPtr` does not provide any new information, as the `ptr: PPtr` field already has an `addr` method that produces a `usize`. This PR deletes this field, saves a bit line, and it may be easier to migrate if Verus supports `dyn` better in the future. @SNoAnd, do you think this change is okay?",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">addr: usize</code> field in <code class=\"notranslate\">ReprPtr</code> does not provide any new information, as the <code class=\"notranslate\">ptr: PPtr</code> field already has an <code class=\"notranslate\">addr</code> method that produces a <code class=\"notranslate\">usize</code>. This PR deletes this field, saves a bit line, and it may be easier to migrate if Verus supports <code class=\"notranslate\">dyn</code> better in the future. <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/SNoAnd/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/SNoAnd\">@SNoAnd</a>, do you think this change is okay?</p>",
