      "body_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">take_inner_perms/put_inner_perms/take_pointsto</code> methods also seem unsound and should be replaced with the <code class=\"notranslate\">new-mut-ref</code> support. However, I ran into some Verus bugs when trying these modifications. I've created an issue in Verus Zulip and I hope there will be response from Verus maintainers soon.</p>",
      "body_text": "The take_inner_perms/put_inner_perms/take_pointsto methods also seem unsound and should be replaced with the new-mut-ref support. However, I ran into some Verus bugs when trying these modifications. I've created an issue in Verus Zulip and I hope there will be response from Verus maintainers soon.",
      "body": "The `take_inner_perms/put_inner_perms/take_pointsto` methods also seem unsound and should be replaced with the `new-mut-ref` support. However, I ran into some Verus bugs when trying these modifications. I've created an issue in Verus Zulip and I hope there will be response from Verus maintainers soon.",
