      "body_html": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">take_inner_perms/put_inner_perms/take_pointsto</code> methods also seem unsound and should be replaced with the <code class=\"notranslate\">new-mut-ref</code> support.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/SNoAnd/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/SNoAnd\">@SNoAnd</a> I find that we no longer need any helper functions like these anymore, as we can directly use <code class=\"notranslate\">&amp;mut</code> in <code class=\"notranslate\">ostd</code> APIs, and it works pretty well!</p>",
      "body_text": "The take_inner_perms/put_inner_perms/take_pointsto methods also seem unsound and should be replaced with the new-mut-ref support.\n\n@SNoAnd I find that we no longer need any helper functions like these anymore, as we can directly use &mut in ostd APIs, and it works pretty well!",
      "body": "> The `take_inner_perms/put_inner_perms/take_pointsto` methods also seem unsound and should be replaced with the `new-mut-ref` support. \r\n\r\n@SNoAnd I find that we no longer need any helper functions like these anymore, as we can directly use `&mut` in `ostd` APIs, and it works pretty well!",
      "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
